{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:46 2026-11-11 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:46 2026-11-11 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:46 2026-11-11 HKT</p><img alt=\"消防到場灌救。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/8f3bc8f64346857205de3345da283d63/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-10_at_23_26_28.jpeg\"/><p>旺角發生火警。今日（11日）早上7時10分，新填地街316至320號一個住宅單位，據報有充電器起火冒煙。消防接報到場，動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，至早上7時39分將火救熄。消息稱，初步最少5人不適，包括1名男嬰；24人疏散。</p><img alt=\"一名男子被送上救護車接受治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/07180d0442258036324558bf197fb7e1/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-10_at_23_32_56.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"男嬰在救護車上接受治理。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/947a953f4ff3725ccfa74047d57e90f3/2026-11/2_9.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"有居民帶同寵物逃生。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ca1a3a92f8ef0d1d6577f2f267b74b60/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_07_51_56_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場灌救。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/0033696b46feab546bf493aa049ad91a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_07_48_39_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"居民疏散。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/1daf92b4ee26d9ebbedcc5af8e202fe2/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_07_48_39.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/467645d9a1a9386bc6501b2ede68d4c7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_07_48_38_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e7c9edf523f8338767f15e4015c9118f/2026-11/1_1_16.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c585c9302a745eefa61ee766af16ebfb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_07_48_38.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/7218a4fbcdc5345d75094c0febda95a2/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_07_48_37.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T00:29:16.064825+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T23:46:48+00:00","fetched_at